OL,3,GNEWSAMural celebrating town's heritage
OL,4,Aunveiled
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new mural has been unveiled in Ossett
OL,7,Ftown centre celebrating the town's
OL,8,F"distinctive heritage".
OL,10,FCommissioned by Wakefield Council and
OL,11,Fcreated by West Yorkshire artist
OL,12,FShiraaz Ali, the artwork has been
OL,13,Finstalled on the side of Richmond's
OL,14,FButchers in Market Place.
OL,16,FNamed Welcome to Ossett, the mural
OL,17,Freplicates the shape of the windows
OL,18,Ffound in the town hall and features
OL,19,Fmany landmarks including the war
OL,20,Fmemorial.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
